      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "腕が立つハル・ハリ族の連中に\n運んでいた大事な商品を盗まれちまった……\n盗まれたのは呪術師の古具だ。その連中が\nいるのは秘奥の祭壇らしい。取り返してくれるか？",
        "official_en": "The skilled Har Hali stole some valuable goods\nI was transporting—a set of spellcaster's relics.\nThe thieves are out at the Secret Altar. Can you\ngo and get my wares back?",
        "real_en": "The skilled Har-Hari stole some valuable goods\nI was transporting—a set of spellcaster's relics.\nThe thieves are out at the Secret Altar. Can you\ngo and get my wares back?"
      },
      "review": {
